      <rules>
        <rule name="Repair" id="a7f7-a600-5797-96e3" hidden="false">
          <description>If a Rhino is immobilised for any reason, then in subsequent turns the driver may attempt to effect a temporary repair instead of shooting. Roll a D6 in the Shooting phase, and on a 6 the vehicle is free to move in its next turn.</description>
        </rule>
