              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Weapons with the Lance special rule do not count a Land Raider Crusader with a Blessed Hull&apos;s armour as 12. It is always counted as 14.</characteristic>
